# Outfit gear (R18): a folded tripod strapped across the back (the part row rolls it), three steel legs, ink head,
# accent straps and a glowing bubble level.
name outfit_tripod
grid 5
size 3 4 20
slot leg Steel
slot head Ink
slot strap SwatchAccent
slot level SwatchGlow
box 1 0 1 2 1 18 leg
box 1 3 1 2 4 18 leg
box 0 1 0 1 3 17 leg
box 0 0 17 3 4 20 head
paint box 0 0 6 3 4 7 strap
paint box 0 0 12 3 4 13 strap
box 2 1 18 3 3 19 level
pivot 0 2 10
